## Files read

- `dashboard/static/games/universe_within.html` — **does not exist** (glob: no match). Draft's path correction is right.
- `dashboard/static/universe_within.html` — the real source (203 lines). All line cites below are this file.
- `watch/inbox/games_polish/p08-universe-within.md` — draft (35 lines; **truncated mid-sentence at L35**, no patch code present).
- Corroborating: `site/dist/games/universe_within.html`, `site/dist/suno/` (4 mp3s, none of this game's), `dashboard/static/suno/` (all 4 present), `dashboard/static/games/swarm.html` L64–69, `site/build.py` L31–34 + L459–463 + L470–480, `dashboard/static/index.html` L104/L221.

## Verdict: **ADJUST**

- Not **APPLY** — the draft's "THE ONE PATCH" section ends mid-word ("stretched rende…", L35); there is no code to apply.
- Not **REJECT** — every finding checks out against source: `fit()` defined L47, bound L48, **never called** (grep confirms zero call sites); `<canvas id="c">` L24 has no dimensions; `#ui{…background:#000f0}` L10 is a 5-digit hex; fade `S(0.,20.,tt)*S(224.,200.,tt)` L140–141 with `edge0>edge1` UB; handlers nulled L162 before `await fetch/decode` L166–167 with no try/catch; `uBoost` hardcoded `0` L194; OOB self-assign L192; x=.15 → ~3.3 kHz not bass L134; dead branch L197. Deploy claims verified (`build.py` ships only 4 unrelated mp3s; `data-f="suno/…"` resolves to `/games/suno/…` 404).
- **Adjustment 1:** fold in the draft's own Presentation-3 (dpr) — it flagged `fit()` as incomplete without it, so fix it in the same line.
- **Adjustment 2:** the draft under-ranks its own Pacing-1. `started` (L181), `srcNode.start()` (L182), and `iTime` (L190) all begin at the reveal — so even after sizing the buffer, the player gets a **20s black screen with music**, plus a UB smoothstep and a full blackout every 230s while `loop=true` (L176). Both hunks fire at the same first frame; ship them together.

## Final code — target file `dashboard/static/universe_within.html`

**Hunk A — size the buffer before first frame** (anchor: L44–49):

```js
const cv=document.getElementById('c');
const gl=cv.getContext('webgl');
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
function fit(){const d=devicePixelRatio||1;cv.width=Math.round(innerWidth*d);cv.height=Math.round(innerHeight*d);gl.viewport(0,0,cv.width,cv.height);}
addEventListener('resize',fit);
fit();
addEventListener('error',e=>{document.title='ERR: '+e.message+' @ line '+(e.lineno||'?');});
```

Diff vs source: `fit()` body gains `devicePixelRatio` scaling (CSS `#c{width:100vw;height:100vh}` L9 keeps display size); new line `fit();` inserted immediately after `addEventListener('resize',fit);`. `iResolution=cv.width,cv.height` (L189) now feeds native-res. Repo precedent: `dashboard/static/estate_walk.html` L79, `wipeout_v2.html` L57.

**Hunk B — drop the Shadertoy export fade** (anchor: L137–142 inside the `FS` template string):

```glsl
    vec3 col=baseCol*m;
    col+=baseCol*glow;
    col*=1.-dot(uv,uv);
    fragColor=vec4(col,1);
```

Diff vs source: delete exactly

```glsl
    float tt=mod(iTime,230.);
    col*=S(0.,20.,tt)*S(224.,200.,tt);
```

Removes the 20s black intro, the `edge0>edge1` UB, and the 224→230s blackout cycle. Vignette line `col*=1.-dot(uv,uv)` stays.

Deploy note: `site/dist/games/universe_within.html` is a copy — `site/build.py` L459–463 falls back to `dashboard/static/<g>` (L32 lists `universe_within.html` in `GAMES`), so a rebuild propagates both hunks.

## Out of this patch (draft findings confirmed, still open)

1. **P0 deploy:** ship `genesis/aerodynamic/flat_beat/dance.mp3` in `site/build.py` (near L470–480) and use `AUDIO_BASES=['../suno/','suno/']` per `swarm.html` L69 — deployed game is 100% dead without both.
2. try/catch + re-enable handlers around L166–167 (bricked menu on any 404).
3. Wire the headline: bass bin not x=.15, feed `uBoost`, delete the L192 no-op loop.
4. Flag-only: `#000f0`→`#000f00` (L10), `.track` 420px vs `overflow:hidden` (L8/L13), `#334` contrast (L19–20).
